WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.220
- I don't think I got to ask you

00:00:02.220 --> 00:00:03.053
this last time you were here,

00:00:03.053 --> 00:00:04.560
but how did you and your husband meet?

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:06.750
'Cause I know, Matt is
an incredible writer.

00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:08.220
He literally wrote one

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.667
