it just changes, I feel like.

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:30.990
But like, if someone can make you laugh,

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:32.730
like that's what we're all looking for.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:35.280
'Cause that's always gonna
be awesome to be around.

